{"diagnosis": "Fetch TB traps `TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000` with `tohost: FAIL 0xdead` vs expected advancing fetch through 256 NOPs (max_addr>0). Excerpt line 1952 in the `if (!resetn || mem_done)` clear block sets `mem_do_rdata <= 1` instead of 0, leaving a spurious data-phase request asserted. That starves `mem_do_rinst`/`mem_do_prefetch` so no instruction fetch completes and progress stays at zero.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1949,7 +1949,7 @@
 		if (!resetn || mem_done) begin
 			mem_do_prefetch <= 0;
 			mem_do_rinst <= 0;
-			mem_do_rdata <= 1;
+			mem_do_rdata <= 0;
 			mem_do_wdata <= 0;
 		end
", "expected": "tohost PASS, no TRAP: no progress, max_addr != 0x00000000"}

